{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-factoryNikolaiDeparts-6640": "NIKOLAI: 上楼顶，抓住那些吊钩。地面交给我们，我们会尽力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leorniaRooftopAssault-6642": "CORDELIA: 但愿他们刚才请求的是放下吊钩。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leorniaRooftopAssault-6643": "BEN: 不然，他们不站屋顶。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leorniaRooftopAssault-6644": "CORDELIA: 啊，对，没有齐卡隆，你又得说那半生不熟的里恩语了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leorniaRooftopAssault-6645": "BEN: 我们有幸运的灵。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-leorniaRooftopAssault-6646": "CORDELIA: 那就登艇吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-airshipCombat1-6649": "CORDELIA: 舵被锁住了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-airshipCombat1-6650": "CORDELIA: 上面那艘应该就是指挥舰，你确定不能带我们飞上去？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-airshipCombat1-6651": "BEN: 往上升，不是容易。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-airshipCombat1-6652": "CORDELIA: 还有一艘离目标更近，高度也与我们相仿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-airshipCombat1-6653": "CORDELIA: 我们能否直接跳过去，由你用魔法控制方向？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-airshipCombat1-6654": "BEN: 女人，你胆子有种，我发誓。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-airshipCombat1-6655": "BEN: 做好那个准备！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-airshipCombat1-6656": "JUNA: 这下，比喻都要变成真的了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-airshipCombat1-6657": "AGATA: 居然还得再跳一次……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-airshipCombat1-6658": "ALEXANDRA: 有、有多远啊……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-airshipCombat1-6659": "JEROME: 要是能活下来，这可够我们讲上好一阵了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-airshipCombat1-6660": "CORDELIA: 我看到指挥舰了，还是比我们高出太多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-airshipCombat1-6661": "CORDELIA: 不过，他们似乎正在把地面上的人吊上来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-airshipCombat1-6662": "CORDELIA: 我们能抓住那个吊钩吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-airshipCombat1-6663": "BEN: 我没看见为什么不行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-airshipCombat1-6664": "BEN: 跳之前，还有一两个片刻。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-airshipCombat1-6665": "BEN: 你们准备，就说我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-benAirshipJump-6667": "BEN: 你们是准备好了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-benAirshipJump-6668": "没有",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-benAirshipJump-6669": "准备好了",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-lastAirshipJump-6670": "CORDELIA: 走吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-lastAirshipJump-6671": "ALEXANDRA: 我收回之前抱怨露宿的话，这才是最糟糕的！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-lastAirshipJump-6672": "JEROME: 这趟冒险真是越来越离谱了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-lastAirshipJump-6673": "AGATA: 最好是最后一次了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-lastAirshipJump-6674": "JUNA: 其实这新鲜空气还挺舒服，可枪林弹雨就免了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-lastAirshipJump-6675": "BEN: 那就，往前跑。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-lastAirshipJump-6677": "BEN: 他没过得来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-lastAirshipJump-6678": "CORDELIA: 他不会来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-lastAirshipJump-6679": "ALEXANDRA: 呃……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-lastAirshipJump-6680": "JEROME: 那你可有得等了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-lastAirshipJump-6681": "AGATA: 再猜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-lastAirshipJump-6682": "JUNA: 嘿，说起他，那可就有意思了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6683": "ZEDLITZ: 看来，你们的国家也并非毫无还手之力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6684": "CORDELIA: 你会莱奥尼亚语？这么说，就是你负责弄到这支舰队的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6685": "CORDELIA: 反正你们自己绝对造不出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6686": "ZEDLITZ: 蚂蚁也能造出惊人的东西，却永远无法主宰世界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6687": "CORDELIA: 而狗呢，也就只会吠叫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6688": "CORDELIA: 他们自以为高人一等，结果也不过如此。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6689": "BEN: 其他的，那些艇，冲我们来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6690": "CORDELIA: 此行的目的已经达成。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6691": "CORDELIA: 我注意到迪亚孔的通风口全都打开了，应该是为了散热。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6692": "CORDELIA: 我们能直接跳进建筑的核心区域吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6693": "BEN: 先等。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6694": "BEN: 底下，那里有麻烦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6695": "JEROME: 你怎么知道？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6696": "ALEXANDRA: 你看得见？我可看不了那么远。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6697": "AGATA: 你怎么知道的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6698": "JUNA: 隔这么远，又有这么多烟，你还能闻见？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6699": "BEN: 我在风里面听到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6700": "BEN: 我们下去安全，但要带特别礼物，来敲门。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6701": "JUNA: 呃，我们看重这家伙，可不是因为他擅长制定计划。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6702": "ALEXANDRA: 你想干什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6703": "JEROME: 某种……军事行动？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6704": "AGATA: 不先把计划说清楚，我是不会跳的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-zedlitzScene-6705": "BEN: 你们会看到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-groundStart-6707": "NIKOLAI: 我们去哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-groundStart-6708": "GORDON: 去迪亚孔的路上，有个小藏身处。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-groundStart-6709": "GORDON: 那一带挨的轰炸没那么严重。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-groundStart-6710": "GORDON: 这边走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-hideawayIntro-6711": "GORDON: 就是那个藏身处。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-hideawayIntro-6712": "GORDON: 通往迪亚孔的街道上布置了严密的防御。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fortifiedStreet-6713": "NIKOLAI: 绝对不行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fortifiedStreet-6714": "NIKOLAI: 绝对不行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fortifiedStreet-6715": "JEROME: 这可不是个好主意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fortifiedStreet-6716": "JUNA: 免了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fortifiedStreet-6717": "AGATA: 我们该另找条路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fortifiedStreet-6718": "ALEXANDRA: （一定有更好的路。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fortifiedStreet-6719": "GORDON: 还是去藏身处看看吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fortifiedStreet-6720": "NIKOLAI: 绝对不行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fortifiedStreet-6721": "NIKOLAI: 绝对不行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fortifiedStreet-6722": "JEROME: 这可不是个好主意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fortifiedStreet-6723": "JUNA: 免了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fortifiedStreet-6724": "AGATA: 我们该另找条路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fortifiedStreet-6725": "ALEXANDRA: （一定有更好的路。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-fortifiedStreet-6726": "GORDON: 还是去藏身处看看吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-hideawayEncounter-6727": "SOLDIER: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-hideawayEncounter-6728": "MAN: 他们走了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-hideawayEncounter-6729": "MAN: 哟，又是这位贵气少爷，怎么还带了一群人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-hideawayEncounter-6730": "GORDON: 他们就是救援队，眼下也只有这些人了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-hideawayEncounter-6731": "MAN: 看来你们还挺顺利啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-hideawayEncounter-6732": "NIKOLAI: 我们想找条路进迪亚孔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-hideawayEncounter-6733": "MAN: 想把手伸进狼嘴里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-hideawayEncounter-6734": "NIKOLAI: 他们已经把一切押在这次进攻上了，只要断掉迪亚孔的能量供应，那些飞空艇就没法继续待在天上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-hideawayEncounter-6735": "MAN: 哦，要是这样，那可就另当别论了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-hideawayEncounter-6736": "MAN: 真想去迪亚孔碰运气，倒是有条路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-hideawayEncounter-6737": "MAN: 我们有几个人，就是从那边的维修通道逃出来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-hideawayEncounter-6738": "MAN: 通道通到修桥用的沉箱，穿过那里，就能爬到他们防线后面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-hideawayEncounter-6739": "NIKOLAI: 你来吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-hideawayEncounter-6740": "GORDON: 要是连试都不去试，我可没脸见人了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-hideawayEncounter-6741": "NIKOLAI: 其余人尽快离开，走远些，下一队巡逻兵很快就会来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-anseitzOfficerEncounter-6742": "OFFICER: 哼，你们能凑出的抵抗力量，就这点？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-anseitzOfficerEncounter-6743": "OFFICER: 那就来吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6744": "<align=\"center\">站住，普罗赫。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6745": "NIKOLAI: 那是……冯·罗尔？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6746": "NIKOLAI: 你在干什么！？你到底想怎样！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6747": "<align=\"center\">让你彻底认清自己的处境。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6748": "<align=\"center\">我手里的人质多得很。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6749": "NIKOLAI: 住手！有本事亲自出来面对我！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6750": "VON ROHR: 放下武器，你就可以独自进来，普罗赫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6751": "VON ROHR: 我不骗你，肯定会杀了你，不过也许会考虑放过这里的人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6752": "ALEXANDRA: 他在撒谎，他就是喜欢杀人，觉得这样好玩。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6753": "AGATA: 他不会放过任何人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6754": "JEROME: 你应该清楚，他在撒谎。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6755": "JUNA: 他的话，一个字都别信。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6756": "ZIKARON: ……谎言……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6757": "NIKOLAI: 我知道，可是……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6758": "<align=\"center\">滴答，滴答，普罗赫。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6759": "NIKOLAI: 住——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6760": "NIKOLAI: 什么声音？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6761": "BEN: 惊喜来了，混蛋们！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6762": "BEN: 多谢你把顶上打开啊，头儿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6763": "BEN: 还有，那些炸弹真好使，难怪你们这么喜欢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6764": "NIKOLAI: 你留在这里，我们会把人质送出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-diaconHostages-6765": "GORDON: 我会带他们去安全的地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6766": "BEN: 嘿，嘿！刚才那一下，看见我穿得多准没有？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6767": "NIKOLAI: 都平安回来了？指挥舰打掉了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6768": "CORDELIA: 两件事都办到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6769": "CORDELIA: 这里还有事要处理，他们把迪亚孔弄得——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6770": "JEROME: 他还活着！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6771": "VON ROHR: 就凭这点……还杀不了我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6772": "NIKOLAI: 很好，我还怕没机会亲自动手呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6773": "BEN: 这家伙总算完了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6774": "NIKOLAI: 得把这些人带出去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6775": "NIKOLAI: 他们可能留了陷阱，也可能已经叫了援军。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6776": "WOMAN: 他说话……和他们一样，他也是他们的人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6777": "AGATA: 这里不安全，你们该走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6778": "MAN: 你到底来自什么样的国家，你的同胞才干得出这种事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6779": "JEROME: 恐怕没时间争论这些了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6780": "MAN: 他们烧了我的房子！我全家都在里面！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6781": "JEROME: 我知道你很痛苦，但现在先别把怒火发在他身上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6782": "MAN: 我说没说完，由我自己说了算！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6783": "CORDELIA: 什么动静？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6784": "MAN: 快跑！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6785": "TECH: 入侵者不知用了什么办法，让迪亚孔改为产生火系魔力，可它根本不是为此设计的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6786": "TECH: 再加上高温和战斗造成的破坏，核心恐怕已经到了失控的边缘。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6787": "TECH: 一旦迪亚孔失控，城里剩下的一切都可能被烧成灰！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6788": "ALEXANDRA: 怎么才能阻止它？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6789": "TECH: 得恢复外壳上所有电容器的运作。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6790": "TECH: 但必须有人留在里面，重启控制组件。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6791": "TECH: 这里会变得……非常热。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6792": "NIKOLAI: 我来，我习惯了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6793": "NIKOLAI: 其他人，要么帮他的忙，要么把人质带走，越远越好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6794": "CORDELIA: 那就快。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6795": "TECH: 就是这里的开关。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6796": "TECH: 看到控制杆弹起来，就用力压下去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6797": "NIKOLAI: 明白。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6798": "TECH: 祝你好运。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6799": "NIKOLAI: 该死……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6800": "NIKOLAI: 这热度还真不是说着玩的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6801": "MAIMUN: 尼古拉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6802": "NIKOLAI: 你看现在像是上课的时候吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6803": "MAIMUN: 你必须替齐卡隆完成最后的使命，他将你带到了这里，却无法亲自施展那道法术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6804": "NIKOLAI: 你在说什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6805": "MAIMUN: 数千年前，我的族人从压迫他们的希纳尔人手中，偷来了一道法术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6806": "MAIMUN: 长久以来，许多人都渴望借助它，挽回我们失去的一切。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6807": "MAIMUN: 可过去始终无法做到，直到现在才终于有了可能。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6808": "NIKOLAI: 我这里还有任务。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6809": "MAIMUN: 没错，现在走近那道能量光束。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6810": "NIKOLAI: 我……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasisScene-6811": "MAIMUN: 汲取那股能量，用它施展法术！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6812": "AGATA: 我……不敢相信。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6813": "BEN: 是谁干的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6814": "BEN: 这里简直像个烤炉……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6815": "BEN: 尼科！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6816": "BEN: 尼科……你怎么把自己弄成这样了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6817": "BEN: 快来人帮忙！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6818": "BEN: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6819": "BEN: 你是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6820": "????: 我是一名医者。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6821": "????: 你的朋友已经十分虚弱。只有这道法术的能量还在维持他的生命，可这股力量也持续不了多久了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6822": "????: 去叫其他人来帮忙吧。我们看看能做些什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6823": "HAELAN: 对不起，尼古拉。我本不该让这一切发生。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6824": "HAELAN: 我曾猜想，过了这么多年，古斯塔夫·海泽应该也和我一样，仍然活着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6825": "HAELAN: 可我没想到，他竟会做出这种事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6826": "HAELAN: 也没有料到，我们的世界会以这样的方式分离，又再次相连。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6827": "HAELAN: 我的时代，还有我所创造的世界，都已走到尽头。往后的路，要由你们决定。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6828": "HAELAN: 但我还可以做最后一件事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6829": "<align=\"center\">……换成我吧…… </align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6830": "BEN: 尼科，你……没事了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6831": "BEN: 那位女士去哪儿了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6832": "NIKOLAI: 我没法……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6833": "BEN: 慢点，伙计。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6834": "NIKOLAI: 我……感觉不到胳膊和腿了。眼睛也……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6835": "JEROME: 放松。你现在什么都不用做。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6836": "NIKOLAI: 那就好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apokatastasis6-6837": "NIKOLAI: 我好累……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6838": "DOCTOR: 慢慢来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6839": "NIKOLAI: 我没事，早就没事了，再待下去才真要闷死了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6840": "CORDELIA: 他可以出院了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6841": "DOCTOR: 他恢复得实在惊人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6842": "DOCTOR: 换作平时，这足以引起一场轰动，不过考虑到最近我们所有人的经历……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6843": "NIKOLAI: 我准备好走了，去哪儿都行，只要别待在这儿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6844": "DOCTOR: 看来你已经决定了，那我去办手续。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6845": "JEROME: 不知你愿不愿意说说，迪亚孔里面究竟发生了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6846": "NIKOLAI: 我要知道就好了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6847": "CORDELIA: 当真？一点也不知道？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6848": "CORDELIA: 虽然我很厌恶这个词，但那件事确实只能称为奇迹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6849": "NIKOLAI: 嗯……我，呃……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6850": "NIKOLAI: 很久以前，有这么个人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6851": "NIKOLAI: 大概是个……哲学家，之类的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6852": "NIKOLAI: 他的话，我可能记得不太准。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6853": "NIKOLAI: 像大家见到的那种魔法……那些关乎整个世界的大事……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6854": "NIKOLAI: 他说，大多数人这辈子都弄不明白。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6855": "NIKOLAI: 他好像还说过……为了弄懂这些，大多数人连放下手头那些事、花上一周工夫都不肯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6856": "NIKOLAI: 可我是个班长。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6857": "NIKOLAI: 班长的活儿，就是把别人的宏图大计落实下去……靠着一只坏罗盘、一张破地图[oxfordComma /]还有半盒子弹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6858": "NIKOLAI: 再说，我恰好在该出现的时候，出现在了该出现的地方，事情能办成，八成都靠这一点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6859": "NIKOLAI: 我知道的，也就这么多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6860": "BEN: 嘿，我觉得这解释就够了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6861": "BEN: 对了，我们有样东西要给你看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6862": "BEN: 你住院这阵子，新朋友们可一直没闲着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-apoEpilogue-6863": "JEROME: 我们得先去火车站，会有人带我们过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6864": "OFFICER: 赫尔蒙特小姐？列车已经尽可能等你们了，必须赶去生产场地了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6865": "LEONA: 让一整列火车等着？亲爱的，你现在可真是风光了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6866": "LEONA: 不过，我得提醒你，不管你多么了不起，我也不会一直给你当秘书。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6867": "LEONA: 信件得你自己来拿，有位科诺弗小姐一直热情洋溢地给你写信，可你一封也没回。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6868": "CORDELIA: 那位年轻的发明家？好吧，那我会记得常回来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6869": "LEONA: 是啊，咱们也想挑个没闹魔法灾难的日子见见你。要是你能抽出空的话。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6870": "OFFICER: 我们真的必须走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6871": "NIKOLAI: 那是……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6872": "AGATA: 这是我们夺下的那艘飞空艇。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6873": "BEN: 你住院的这段时间，他们一直在改装它，猜猜谁负责？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6874": "ALEXANDRA: 马上就能起飞了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6875": "ALEXANDRA: 还得试试跨越世界的魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6876": "NIKOLAI: 什么魔法？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6877": "CORDELIA: 自从其他世界的存在公之于众，我们的研究人员就一直在改造这艘飞空艇，好让它能在各个世界之间穿行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6878": "CORDELIA: 这并不容易，幸好我们这里有位最合适的人选。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6879": "ALEXANDRA: 其实那只是个意外，至少一开始是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6880": "NIKOLAI: 那就开出去兜一圈吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6881": "NIKOLAI: 不赖。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6882": "BEN: 比让我拖着你们到处跑，可强多了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6883": "CORDELIA: 嗯……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6884": "KERAUNOS: 各位好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6885": "BEN: 哦，是你啊，老兄，我们可有一大堆事要告诉你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6886": "KERAUNOS: 我已亲眼见了不少，也听说了不少。倒是我有消息要告诉各位。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6887": "KERAUNOS: 奥斯伦未能夺得新的魔力来源，局势已然逆转。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6888": "KERAUNOS: 此刻，他们的军队已经开始撤退。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6889": "KERAUNOS: 那个自称乌拉尔特总理的人，已回到这一切的起点——尼巴罗斯山顶。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6890": "CORDELIA: 他究竟想做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6891": "KERAUNOS: 这我尚不知晓。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6892": "KERAUNOS: 他的所作所为已两度给世界带来浩劫，如今也许会孤注一掷。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6893": "KERAUNOS: 你们必须阻止这样的灾难第三次发生。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6894": "AGATA: 你不能和我们一起去吗？合我们之力……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6895": "KERAUNOS: 我已考虑许久……但我不能再回尼巴罗斯。乌拉尔特或许正盼着我出现，好引发另一场灾难。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6896": "KERAUNOS: 若你们在尼巴罗斯之巅击败乌拉尔特，魔法与世界的未来，将由你们掌握，而非由我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6897": "KERAUNOS: 这艘飞空艇应该能带你们直抵山顶，但切勿耽搁太久，以免乌拉尔特再生恶计。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6898": "KERAUNOS: 再会。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6899": "BEN: 他还真懂得怎么登场才够派头，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6900": "ALEXANDRA: 那个，我说……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6901": "ALEXANDRA: 既然我们要去对付那个人，又不知道之后会怎样……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6902": "ALEXANDRA: 能不能先绕个地方？我只是想知道，妈妈和哥哥怎么样了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6903": "BEN: 是啊，我也想回趟家，都欠了大约十五个月房租了，但愿他们还没把我的东西全收走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6904": "NIKOLAI: 既然军队在撤退，那我的家乡就要变成前线了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6905": "CORDELIA: 最后的任务之前，理应做好充分的装备准备，也该了结那些尚未了结的事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6906": "ALEXANDRA: 好！决定先去哪儿，就告诉我！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6907": "要保存游戏吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6908": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10scenes.yarn-c10departure-6909": "否"
}
